{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-62625-r4522759","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Apple Streusel Muffins","sourcePageId":62625,"sourceRevision":"4522759","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-07-11T19:45:50Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Apple%20Streusel%20Muffins&oldid=4522759","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:22:53.744Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baking recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for muffins","Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour","Category:Recipes using apple","Category:Recipes using baking powder","Category:Recipes using brown sugar","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using cow milk","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon","Category:Recipes using margarine","Category:Recipes using white sugar","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"99cf2479b4d5adb6c2449959cf012eea85334f10b73ac8f54604d7457226e596","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__\n{{recipesummary|category=Breakfast recipes|yield=12 muffins|time=20–25 minutes|difficulty=3|energy=237 calories per muffin\n}}\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Bread|Bread]] | [[Cookbook:Breakfast Recipes|Breakfast]]\n\nA delicious muffin recipe filled with apples.\n\n==Ingredients==\n\n=== Streusel topping ===\n*½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]]\n*¼ cup [[Cookbook:Flour|all-purpose flour]]\n*½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n\n=== Batter ===\n*¼ cup [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]] or [[Cookbook:Margarine|margarine]], softened\n*1 ½ cups all-purpose flour\n*1 ½ tsp cinnamon\n* ½ cup white [[Cookbook:Sugar|granulated sugar]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Baking Powder|baking powder]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]]\n* ⅔ cup (180 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]]) [[Cookbook:Milk|milk]]\n* ¼ cup (60 ml) [[Cookbook:Oil|cooking oil]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Grater|grated]] [[Cookbook:Apple|apple]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n=== Streusel topping ===\n#Combine brown sugar, flour, and cinnamon in a [[Cookbook:Mixing Bowl|mixing bowl]].\n#Cut in until mixture resembles coarse crumbs. Set aside.\n\n=== Batter ===\n#Combine softened margarine/butter, flour, cinnamon, sugar, and baking powder in a [[Cookbook:Mixing Bowl|mixing bowl]]. Make a well in the center.\n#Beat egg, milk, and oil in a small bowl. Stir in apple. Pour into well. Stir until just moistened.\n#Fill standard [[Cookbook:Muffin Pan|muffin cups]] ¾ full with batter. Sprinkle streusel topping over the batter.\n#[[cookbook:Baking|Bake]] at [[Cookbook:Oven temperatures|400 °F]] (200 °C) for 15 to 20 minutes or until golden.\n\n==Notes, tips and variations==\n*The muffins taste best when still warm.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using apple]]\n[[Category:Recipes for muffins]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using white sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]\n[[C